    "buggy_baseline_is_parent": true,
    "single_parent_matches_baseline": true,
    "commit_message": "Keep the shebang on its own line in OrderedImports\n\nThe newline that ends a shebang line is stored as leading trivia on the\nfirst statement. Reordering imports treated it as a leading blank line of\nthe file header and dropped it, which pulled the following comment or\nimport up onto the shebang line.\n\nThe earlier fix special-cased files with no imports, but the same thing\nhappens when the file has imports. Restore the shebang's leading newlines\nafter reordering instead, so it works with or without imports.\n\nFixes #1194.",
